+# Troubleshooting
+
+## Common Build Problems
+
+1. _Build failed due to Java heap space memory:_
+
+    Set `org.gradle.jvmargs=-Xmx2048m` in a `gradle.properties`.
+
+    If it still fails, you can further increase the memory.
+
